{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-10_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-10","title":"Extinguished Flames","storyCode":"4-10","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"99eb89f3cc865e5fbd4166ae0e891a61e51e7fd597b1403f5766ba97bc0f1d8e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite! We've managed to push the Yeti Squadron back!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I seem to have underestimated you, Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Perhaps I held back a bit too much."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(I can't feel my fingers anymore... Damn it...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...What's going on...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The cold current... is still gathering around her?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"This time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"You won't be so lucky."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Is she trying to absorb all the ice surrounding us and release it at once? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——♩——♬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...She's going to drain all the heat from our bodies!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"These Arts are on a complete different scale from what we saw before...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Let it all come to an end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"May your anger be buried by purest frost."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...Nnngh...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...♩..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Something... is stopping the cold from gathering..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...Gah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Is this your doing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Didn't I already tell you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't let you... come any closer...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...Did you disrupt my cold current using your own Arts?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...What a good kid."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf used her blade to sever the cold current...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"But, but... she can't hold out long in that condition!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Her blade... it's about to break!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...That's more than enough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"This is our last chance!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya... now is the time!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Cover me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Starting firing - suppress Reunion's movements!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite, go!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"On my way...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"What?! The enemy is... rushing towards us?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"No, she's... she's going straight towards FrostNova?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"As if we'd let you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Fire!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Agh...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry, it wasn't a direct hit!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"She, she's still able to run?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Damn it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I told you! You'll never reach the Yetis!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Keep firing! Don't give her an opening!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...Oh no!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Gaah...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Nooo!! She... she was hit... It can't be..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...It's just a scratch! You'll have to do better than that if you want to stop me!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"More... I need to do more..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(The flow of the cold air... fluctuated for a moment?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait... Where is that flow coming from..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I know this feeling...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Could it be...?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll just have to give this a try!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to hit it...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, believe in me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island's leader..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"She shattered the Originium we planted with her Arts?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"It's getting hazy..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I knew it! FrostNova created that cold current by planting Originium!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite!! Now's your chance!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I promise to save you!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"So, wait for me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Please wait for me!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Wake up!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Nnh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"I've got you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Who..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Up here! Quick! Hold on to me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteo...rite?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Who said you could play the hero?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you think I could just sit there and watch you die?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Put me down... I'm not... some pet..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't let go of you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya! Jessica!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...All right!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, let's get out of here!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Meteorite, go ahead with Frostleaf. I'll cover your retreat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...Gah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Haah... Haah..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf... hang in there...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't die... don't you dare die on me!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't worry... you can't get rid of me that easily..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Jeez, both you and Amiya too! Why do both of you have to be like this?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"No matter how strong you might be... you're both just kids after all!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"You're still treating me like a kid...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...If I could save all of you by giving up my life, I think that's a pretty good deal."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"You... Mark my words! If you ever try to do something like this again..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"If you ever... I'd..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"*sigh*... Sorry."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Start running, Meteorite."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't... look back...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Hurry! Just go!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Evacuate this area immediately! Protect the medics and the injured!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Snipers...! Aim at those effigies. Keep firing!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Disrupt their formation! Demolish the entire building to cover our escape!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"The explosions are making the haze thicker...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Here's our opening! Get moving!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone, we're retreating from this square!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"So... they got away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"How long have you been watching?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Just a few minutes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"These warriors are worthy of praise."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Tch."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Be careful."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Your body isn't in very good condition."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...I don't need you to remind me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"Just do what you need to do, old timer."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm going to go after Rhodes Island."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"We have to get rid of them first. Only then, will we be able..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FrostNova","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"...to go to Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"???","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Haah......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're almost at the escape point."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, we..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...Amiya!! We've finally gotten through to the L.G.D.!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"It's an emergency communication!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Listen... up..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en? Can you hear me clearly?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Lungmen..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"...What's going on?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...I'm safe now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"But..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...Reunion took over one of our important facilities and is now forcefully opening a passage between the slums and the outer city."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Amiya..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Lungmen... is in danger."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"............"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"item_tll"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"W managed to lure Lungmen and Rhodes Island right into our trap."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"That's right. They won't be able to escape. Faust and Crownslayer have already broken their defenses at one location."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"As you said, this will be our opening to flood into Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"We will set up ambushes around every corner. The road to Lungmen will run red with fresh blood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Right, that old flag-waver should be coming back to Chernobog soon."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Our victory is assured."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Do you have any other orders for me, Talulah?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"The time is upon us..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Talulah","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"...to turn this rotten city into ashes."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["FrostNova"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf","FrostNova"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["???","Meteorite"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["Jessica"]}]}
